{"strings": [
  {"text":"Moominpappa at Sea","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json title"},
  {"text":"The end of August: everything in the valley is done, and Moominpappa takes his family to a bare island with a dark lighthouse. Each of them looks for a place of their own there — and each finds a loneliness. Whom does Papa notice, and whom does he miss?","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json description"},
  {"text":"A bare island, a dark lighthouse, one lantern for the whole family — and whom will Papa give it to?","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json line"},
  {"text":"after the novel by Tove Jansson","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/game.json source"},
  {"text":"The Crossing","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The lantern in the boat","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put it out","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Give it to the son","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Ask him to breakfast","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit beside him in silence","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We steer by that star. The captain knows the way","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The moon’s path. Pretty","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Put out the lantern. We’ll go by the stars","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where are we?","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Where we ought to be","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Leave it burning. Mama will wake up and be frightened","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Here. Shine it back, since you’re looking","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"So… a bit to the left… I think","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"23 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"A keeper always leaves the key. That’s how it’s done","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"There’s an arrow here. For fools","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody has been here","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Gulls","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Enough for three lanterns","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"When the wind drops I’ll sail for more. This is going to be our home","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Wind south-west. Nobody again","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve covered him up","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t need it any more","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"“We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Sit down beside him without a word","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We are the new keepers. If anything happens — you know where to find us","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"We have breakfast by the lighthouse. Do come","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"No need","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma bakes pancakes…","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The sea is good today","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"Good","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"All done","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/1.js"},
  {"text":"The Lighthouse Is Dark","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Papa’s day","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the pool","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Carry seaweed for Mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Whose lantern tonight","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama, with a term","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The son, no questions","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He doesn’t want to","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It’s you who can’t","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse takes time!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mine","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"How beautiful you are…","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Measure the black pool","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Go to the Fisherman and ask about the lighthouse","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Nothing will grow here","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"It will for me","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Why isn’t he lit?","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"He shines outward","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll understand you. You’ll see","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The bread was taken","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse is lit at dusk","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"So light it, then","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it. I can see well enough","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it, take it","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Can I have the lantern? For the whole night","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"What for?","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"I need it","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Night 1, 23/24 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Up to the lamp: “Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama: “The captain sets a term. Not lit by the full moon — we turn for home.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"To the son: “Take it. I won’t ask.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"By turns: “Mama till bedtime, then me, toward morning — you.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Till I light it, I sleep by the lamp","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"“In wind, warm the burner with paraffin till the flame turns blue. Do not let go before.”","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"The captain sets a term. If it isn’t lit by the full moon — we turn for home","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three nights till the full moon","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Three","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Home? Where everything’s done?","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Somebody is crying","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Take it. I won’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"There. That’s for you","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama till bedtime, then me, and toward morning — you","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"All right","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/2.js"},
  {"text":"Mama’s Garden","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mama in the wall","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking” — and up","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call her","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"A cup, and wait","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2: the hand on the lantern","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Don’t open your eyes","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Put it back”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Go after him","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"24 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Trees don’t walk","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"They’re afraid","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Toughening up. Quite right","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Ti-iny, isn’t it","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And no Papa","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"He’s at the lighthouse","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"That’s new. Wasn’t there this morning","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Fine","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“She’s out walking. The island is small” — and up to the lamp","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Call: “Mamma! Mamma!” — his palm on the wall","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Put a cup of tea by the wall and sit down to wait. Not to move, whoever comes","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"She’s out walking. The island is small","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Mamma! Mamma!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I only lay down for a moment under the apple tree","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Two more nights","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Pappa, I…","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Shh. Later","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"And I found a line here, by the way. The old keeper’s. By myself, under the dust","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"How good that you noticed","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Night 2, 24/25 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed is empty: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Let it burn low. Somebody’s howling","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“Where are you going? Put it back. I need it.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Moomintroll knows that his father knows.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? Put it back. I need it","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“The oil is thick: warm it in a pan on the stove, carry it wrapped. On a quiet evening the warm oil runs by itself; in wind — only with paraffin.”","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"“I won’t ask” is broken.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Up top the camp bed stays empty till morning: “I sleep by the lamp” is broken.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"You promised not to ask","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"I didn’t ask","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"Spy","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/3.js"},
  {"text":"The Storm","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where Papa is in the storm","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"To the Fisherman on the cape","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The burner — and run down","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3: the paw on his shoulder","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“As far as the dune”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"25 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There’s going to be a storm","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"With one paw, you might say. Against the wind","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"He pulled too","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son takes the lantern to the Groke. Every night","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke. The one you left him","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you watched and lay there","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son took the lantern to the Groke last night. And you snored. Pretending","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Your son goes to the Groke at night. Without a lantern. He sits there and freezes","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama was in the wall all day yesterday. She came out when you weren’t there","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"My","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama knows where the boy goes at night.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Bread again","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The stove’s flooded","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Full moon","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the lighthouse with the last of the paraffin","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Hold the door with everyone: “When it drops, we sail home.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Go out to the cape, to the Fisherman","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Light the burner — and run down to the door","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Man overboard. The captain is going","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Have you gone mad?","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going, in such water?","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well, there","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Be careful out there","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t take it! Do you hear? You won’t take it!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The oil is warm. Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Till it turns blue","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Well. Come on","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"When it drops, we sail home","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The captain remembers","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve told that one","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I want to go home","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Pass me the blanket","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"You won’t get me!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"On a night like this he ought to burn","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"The Fisherman spoke to Papa.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"26 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, you see","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"There, there. It’s all right","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Night 3, 26/27 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Later","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Without a lantern? She’ll freeze you","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let her","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Where are you going? To freeze again?","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I need to","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Tell him","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Let him go.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Mama is right.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"“Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune.”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Let him go","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"She isn’t frightening. She’s just cold","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Mama is right","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Come on. I’ll go with you as far as the dune","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go on by myself from here","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/4.js"},
  {"text":"Epilogue","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"27 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The Beam","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A week later","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I can now","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Ha. I know","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The lighthouse shone far. For everyone who was at sea","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Boat to the Valley","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain keeps his word","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"The captain didn’t light it","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"That’s not how it was","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Pie on the Cape","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A wave — higher than the lighthouse. And we sit there. Like two rocks","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Yesterday it wasn’t like that","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Today is his birthday","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"At last","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll go and wash the tin","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Go on, go on","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“27 August. Quiet.”","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"“I am forty today. Nobody knows.” Forty! Old!","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You shouldn’t have","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Tomorrow will be quiet too","who":"fisher","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Halfway up the Stair","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Up top and down below. The captain is in time everywhere","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"You were everywhere","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"Papa sat on the stair. The sea was silent","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/epilogue.js"},
  {"text":"A Quiet August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"How to tell them","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To everyone at supper","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To Mama, in the evening","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"20 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At the end of August everything in the valley was already done. Papa walked about the garden looking for something to do","who":"narrator","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Fire! I’ve put out a fire!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I put out a fire","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"A lighthouse. And not lit","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"But somebody must have lived there","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"At supper, to everyone at once: “We’re moving to the lighthouse!”","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Tell Mama in the evening, when the children are asleep","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"We’re moving to the lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Hooray!","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"To the lighthouse? For good?","who":"troll","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"I’ll pack our things","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Is there any earth there?","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"There’s a lighthouse there!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"All right. I’ll take my paints","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"You’ve already decided everything. Boring","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Leave the candles. There’s a lighthouse!","who":"papa","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"And your paints?","who":"my","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"Something will turn up there","who":"mama","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"22 August","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/chapters/prologue.js"},
  {"text":"If you keep it, the chapters after this one will have to be played again.","translation":"","where":"games/moominpappa-at-sea/bespoke/game.js"},
